OL,3,GNEWSAI had to learn to walk again after
OL,4,Ahit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Fiona Magill was struck by a van
OL,7,Fshe was left with a shattered pelvis,
OL,8,Ftwo broken vertebrae and a broken leg.
OL,10,FThe mother of two said she still wakes
OL,11,Fup in pain every day.
OL,13,F"It was two major surgeries, four
OL,14,Fmonths in a wheelchair, and I had to
OL,15,Flearn to walk again," she said.
OL,17,FAntrim GAA footballer Kavan Keenan, who
OL,18,Fwas driving the van in October 2024,
OL,19,Fwas recently handed a nine month
OL,20,Fsuspended prison sentence and a
OL,21,F12-month driving ban.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
